LangString AwakeDataSubtitle ${LANG_TRADCHINESE} "選擇帳戶、實例及設定的儲存位置。"
LangString AwakeDataNormal ${LANG_TRADCHINESE} "一般 - AppData\Roaming\AwakeLauncher"
LangString AwakeDataCompact ${LANG_TRADCHINESE} "精簡 - 安裝資料夾內的 AwakeLauncherData"
LangString AwakeDataCustom ${LANG_TRADCHINESE} "自訂 - 選擇資料夾"
LangString AwakeBrowse ${LANG_TRADCHINESE} "瀏覽..."
